## Overview

Fix WritableStreamDefaultController to store callbacks as V8 Global handles instead of raw Local pointers.

## Current Broken Code

### Storage Definition \(WritableStreamDefaultController.zig:46-97\)

```zig
pub const InternalState = struct {
    start_algorithm: ?*const anyopaque,    // LINE 62 - BROKEN: stores Local
    write_algorithm: ?*const anyopaque,     // LINE 51 - BROKEN
    close_algorithm: ?*const anyopaque,     // LINE 54 - BROKEN
    abort_algorithm: ?*const anyopaque,     // LINE 57 - BROKEN
    strategy_size_algorithm: ?*const anyopaque,  // LINE 68 - BROKEN
    // ...
}\;
```

### Storage Assignment \(WritableStream.zig:714-731\)

```zig
controller_internal.* = .{
    // ...
    .start_algorithm = startAlgorithm,  // LINE 719 - stores raw Local pointer
    .write_algorithm = writeAlgorithm,
    .close_algorithm = closeAlgorithm,
    .abort_algorithm = abortAlgorithm,
    // ...
