### Problems

1. No null check before using `transformer`
2. No alignment check \(V8 Global\<Object\> requires 8-byte alignment\)
3. No pointer tag check \(codebase uses 2-bit tagging\)
4. No type validation \(could be a Zig struct, not a V8 handle\)

## Required Fix

Add validation before using the transformer as a V8 Object:

```zig
fn setUpTransformStreamDefaultControllerFromTransformer\(
    instance: *runtime.Instance,
    internal: *InternalState,
    allocator: std.mem.Allocator,
    ctx: ?*runtime.ExecutionContext,
    transformer: ?*const anyopaque,  // Made optional
\) \!void {
    // Early return if no transformer provided
    if \(transformer == null\) {
        controller_state.own._internal = controller_internal\;
        internal.controller = controller\;
        return\;
    }

    const transformer_ptr = transformer.?\;

    // Check for V8 context availability
    const isolate = v8.v8_Isolate_GetCurrent\(\) orelse {
        // No V8 context - pure Zig construction, skip V8 extraction
        controller_state.own._internal = controller_internal\;
        internal.controller = controller\;
        return\;
    }\;

    // Untag the pointer if tagged
    const pointer_tag = @import\("../../runtime/engines/v8/pointer_tag.zig"\)\;
    const untagged = pointer_tag.untagPointer\(@ptrCast\(transformer_ptr\)\)\;

    switch \(untagged.tag\) {
        .runtime_instance =\> {
            // This is a Zig runtime instance, not a V8 object
            // Cannot extract JS callbacks from it - use default algorithms
            controller_state.own._internal = controller_internal\;
            internal.controller = controller\;
            return\;
        },
        .global_handle =\> {
            // Valid V8 Global handle - can use with V8 FFI
            const v8_obj: *v8.Object = @ptrCast\(@alignCast\(untagged.ptr\)\)\;
            // ... existing callback extraction logic ...
        },
        .local_value =\> {
            // V8 Local handle - need to check if still valid
            const v8_val: *v8.Value = @ptrCast\(untagged.ptr\)\;
            if \(\!v8.v8_Value_IsObject\(v8_val\)\) {
                // Not an object - use default algorithms
                controller_state.own._internal = controller_internal\;
                internal.controller = controller\;
                return\;
            }
            // ... extract callbacks ...
        },
        .untagged =\> {
            // Legacy untagged pointer - validate alignment
            const addr = @intFromPtr\(untagged.ptr\)\;
            if \(addr % 8 \!= 0\) {
                // Misaligned - definitely not a valid V8 Global handle
                controller_state.own._internal = controller_internal\;
                internal.controller = controller\;
                return\;
            }
            // ... try to use as V8 object with caution ...
        },
    }
}
```

