readable_stream_async_iterator.zig casts AsyncPromise pointers through anyopaque, treating Zig heap pointers as V8 handles.

## Current Code \(readable_stream_async_iterator.zig:127-134\)

```zig
// Extract the handle pointer from JSValue and untag V8 pointer before casting
const handle_ptr = switch \(read_result_js_value\) {
    .handle =\> \|h\| h.ptr,
    .instance =\> \|ptr\| ptr,
    else =\> return error.TypeError,
}\;
