## Problem

`src/html/event_loop/microtask.zig` and `src/html/event_loop/task.zig` use `*anyopaque` for callback contexts.

## Solution

Use the `TypedCallback` pattern from `src/runtime/typed_callback.zig`:

```zig
const typed_callback = @import\("runtime"\).typed_callback\;

pub const Microtask = struct {
    callback: TypedMicrotaskCallback,

    pub fn execute\(self: *Microtask\) void {
        self.callback.invoke\(\)\;
    }
