## Problem

The `StaticRangeInit` dictionary fields \(`startContainer`, `endContainer`\) are tagged pointers.

## Fix

```zig
const pointer_tag = @import\("v8"\).pointer_tag\;

// startContainer
const start_untagged = pointer_tag.untagPointer\(init.startContainer\)\;
const start_container = switch \(start_untagged.tag\) {
    .runtime_instance =\> @as\(*Node, @ptrCast\(@alignCast\(start_untagged.ptr\)\)\),
    else =\> blk: {
        const v8_obj: *v8.Object = @ptrCast\(start_untagged.ptr\)\;
        // Extract Node from V8 internal field
        break :blk try extractNodeFromV8\(v8_obj\)\;
    },
}\;

// endContainer - same pattern
const end_untagged = pointer_tag.untagPointer\(init.endContainer\)\;
// ...
```

