- [ ] Handles null start (defaults to 0)
- [ ] Handles null end (defaults to size)
- [ ] Handles negative start (from end)
- [ ] Handles negative end (from end)
- [ ] Handles start >= end (returns empty)
- [ ] Handles out-of-bounds indices (clamped)
- [ ] ContentType normalized (lowercase, validated)
- [ ] ContentType not inherited when null
- [ ] All test cases pass
- [ ] Memory leak free

