## Problem

`tests/wpt_runner/browser_context.zig` has ~70 instances of `@ptrCast\(v8_value\)` for V8 FFI type conversions:

```zig
// Line 384: Casting V8 String to Value for Object.Set
_ = v8.ffi.v8_Object_Set\(global_obj, context, @ptrCast\(window_key\), @ptrCast\(global_obj\)\)\;

// Line 2373: Casting V8 Integer to Value
const status_val: *v8.ffi.Value = @ptrCast\(v8.ffi.v8_Integer_New\(isolate, 200\)\)\;

// Line 1813: Getting function to call
const callback_fn: *v8.ffi.Function = @ptrCast\(callback_value\)\;
```

While these casts are necessary at the FFI boundary, we can make them safer with helper functions.

## Current Pattern

```zig
// Unsafe - no type check
const callback_fn: *v8.ffi.Function = @ptrCast\(callback_value\)\;
_ = v8.ffi.v8_Function_Call\(callback_fn, ...\)\;
```

## Target Pattern

```zig
// Safe - with type check
const callback_fn = v8.helpers.asFunction\(callback_value\) orelse return error.NotAFunction\;
_ = v8.ffi.v8_Function_Call\(callback_fn, ...\)\;
```

## Proposed Helpers

Add to `src/runtime/engines/v8/helpers.zig` \(new file\):

```zig
const ffi = @import\("ffi.zig"\)\;

/// Safely cast Value to Function if it is one
pub fn asFunction\(value: *ffi.Value\) ?*ffi.Function {
    if \(ffi.v8_Value_IsFunction\(value\)\) {
        return @ptrCast\(value\)\;
    }
    return null\;
}

/// Safely cast Value to Object if it is one
pub fn asObject\(value: *ffi.Value\) ?*ffi.Object {
    if \(ffi.v8_Value_IsObject\(value\)\) {
        return @ptrCast\(value\)\;
    }
    return null\;
}

/// Safely cast Value to String if it is one
pub fn asString\(value: *ffi.Value\) ?*ffi.String {
    if \(ffi.v8_Value_IsString\(value\)\) {
        return @ptrCast\(value\)\;
    }
    return null\;
}

/// Safely cast Value to Array if it is one
pub fn asArray\(value: *ffi.Value\) ?*ffi.Array {
    if \(ffi.v8_Value_IsArray\(value\)\) {
        return @ptrCast\(value\)\;
    }
    return null\;
}

/// Cast specific types to Value \(always safe - upcast\)
pub fn toValue\(specific: anytype\) *ffi.Value {
    return @ptrCast\(specific\)\;
}
```

