### Error Handling
- Promise rejects if stream creation fails
- Promise rejects if reading fails
- Promise rejects if ArrayBuffer allocation fails

### Memory Ownership
- text() returns owned string (caller must free)
- arrayBuffer() returns ArrayBuffer managed by JS runtime
- bytes() returns Uint8Array managed by JS runtime

