**Issues**: whatwg-realm-objects

[Default] toJSON and other object creation must use correct realm:

```zig
// toJSON implementation pattern
pub fn toJSON\(instance: *Instance\) \!v8.Object {
    // Get the realm where this method is defined \(from prototype chain\)
    const method_realm = instance.getRelevantRealm\(\)\;

    // Create result object in METHOD's realm, not caller's
    const result = method_realm.createObject\(\)\;

    // Set properties - note attribute values may come from different realms
    try result.set\("x", instance.get_x\(\)\)\;
    try result.set\("y", instance.get_y\(\)\)\;

    return result\;
}
