   - Add `unwrapV8Instance` helper \(or import from shared location\)
   - Fix lines 788-789 to use unwrapping
   - Handle errors appropriately \(return TypeError per spec\)

2. Consider adding helper to `src/runtime/engines/v8/interface.zig` for reuse

