## Problem

11 impl files have IDENTICAL registry pattern code that should be extracted to a shared utility.

## Files Using This Pattern
- EventTarget.zig
- CharacterData.zig
- Element.zig
- Text.zig
- Node.zig
- Comment.zig
- ShadowRoot.zig
- DocumentType.zig
- HTMLElement.zig
- DocumentFragment.zig
