## Code Changes Required

### 1. HTMLIFrameElement.zig - get_contentDocument\(\)

```zig
/// Getter for contentDocument
/// Returns the nested document if same-origin, null otherwise.
/// Per HTML Standard §4.8.5
pub fn get_contentDocument\(instance: *runtime.Instance\) anyerror\!?*runtime.Instance {
    const internal = getInternal\(instance\) orelse return null\;

    // 1. If no content navigable, return null
    const browsing_ctx = internal.integration.browsing_context orelse return null\;

    // 2. Get the active document
    const document = browsing_ctx.active_document orelse return null\;

    // 3. Get accessor origin from current V8 execution context
    const ctx = instance.ctx\;
    const accessor_origin = try ctx.getCurrentOrigin\(\)\;

    // 4. Check same origin-domain
    if \(\!internal.integration.isContentDocumentAccessible\(accessor_origin\)\) {
        return null\;
    }

    // 5. Return the document
    return document\;
}
```

### 2. runtime/Context - Add getCurrentOrigin\(\)

If not already present, add method to get current execution origin:

```zig
/// Get the origin of the current execution context
pub fn getCurrentOrigin\(self: *Context\) \!Origin {
    // Get the current V8 context's origin
    // This is typically from the incumbent settings object
    if \(self.incumbent_settings\) \|settings\| {
        return settings.origin\;
    }
    // Fallback to opaque origin if no settings
    return Origin.createOpaque\(\)\;
}
```

### 3. Update isContentDocumentAccessible\(\) in iframe_integration.zig

Ensure same-origin-domain check is correct:

```zig
/// Check if the content document is accessible to the given origin
/// Per HTML §4.8.5, returns true if same origin-domain
pub fn isContentDocumentAccessible\(self: *IFrameIntegration, accessor_origin: Origin\) bool {
    const browsing_ctx = self.browsing_context orelse return false\;
    const doc = browsing_ctx.active_document orelse return false\;

    // Get document's origin \(from window proxy or document itself\)
    const doc_origin = if \(self.window_proxy\) \|proxy\|
        proxy.getDocumentOrigin\(\)
    else
        return false\;

    // Check same origin-domain
    return accessor_origin.isSameOriginDomain\(doc_origin\)\;
}
```

