From research.md Section 3.2 (Snapshots):
1. Embed snapshot blob via `@embedFile` or persist to disk
2. Initialize Isolate using `v8::Isolate::CreateParams` with `snapshot_blob` field
3. Reduce context creation time to under 2ms

