## Bug Locations

**File:** `src/webidl/impls/Element.zig`

\| Line \| Pattern \| Likely Function \|
\|------\|---------\|-----------------\|
\| 2294 \| `@ptrCast\(@alignCast\(@constCast\(nodes\)\)\)` \| `append\(\)` or `prepend\(\)` \|
\| 2322 \| `@ptrCast\(@alignCast\(@constCast\(nodes\)\)\)` \| `replaceChildren\(\)` \|
\| 2511 \| `@ptrCast\(@alignCast\(@constCast\(nodes\)\)\)` \| `after\(\)` or `before\(\)` \|
\| 2898 \| `@ptrCast\(@alignCast\(@constCast\(...\)\)\)` \| `insertAdjacentElement\(\)` \|
