- [ ] canSet correctly handles all guard modes
- [ ] canDelete correctly handles all guard modes
- [ ] request-no-cors mode tracks cumulative safelist value size
- [ ] Unit tests for each guard mode
- [ ] Unit tests for edge cases (boundary of safelist size)

