## Problem

Stream controllers use `toAnyopaque` for chunk/error values across multiple impl files:
- `ReadableStreamDefaultController.zig` 
- `WritableStreamDefaultController.zig`
- `TransformStreamDefaultController.zig`

## Analysis

Per `specs/idl/streams.idl`:
```idl
interface ReadableStreamDefaultController {
  undefined enqueue\(optional any chunk\)\;
  undefined error\(optional any e\)\;
  undefined close\(\)\;
}\;
```

The `any` type maps to `runtime.JSValue` in the codebase.

## Solution

Use `runtime.JSValue` directly instead of `*anyopaque`:

```zig
pub fn enqueue\(self: *Self, chunk: runtime.JSValue\) \!void {
    // ...
}

pub fn error\(self: *Self, reason: runtime.JSValue\) \!void {
    // ...
}
```

