## Problem

30+ impl files have variations of `getInternal\(\)` / `getInternalState\(\)` that should be unified into a shared utility.

## Current Patterns Found

### Pattern A - Direct State Access \(most common, ~758 usages\)
```zig
fn getInternal\(instance: *runtime.Instance\) ?*InternalState {
    const state = instance.getState\(State\)\;
    return state.own._internal\;
}
```
Files: NavigateEvent, DOMParser, FileReader, Window, FormData, DOMRectList, File, Blob, Selection, etc.

### Pattern B - Registry-Based \(11 files\)
```zig
fn getInternalFromRegistry\(instance: *runtime.Instance\) ?*InternalState {
    ensureXxxRegistry\(\)\;
    return xxx_registry.get\(@intFromPtr\(instance\)\)\;
}
```
Files: EventTarget, CharacterData, Element, Text, Node, etc. \(covered by InstanceRegistry task\)

### Pattern C - Pointer Cast \(6 files\)
```zig
fn getInternal\(instance: *runtime.Instance\) *InternalState {
    const state = instance.getState\(State\)\;
    return @ptrCast\(@alignCast\(state.own._internal\)\)\;
}
```
Files: NodeIterator, MutationRecord, DOMImplementation, TreeWalker, ShadowRoot, MutationObserver

## Solution

Create `src/webidl/utils/internal_state.zig`:

```zig
pub fn InternalStateAccessor\(comptime T: type\) type {
    return struct {
        pub fn get\(instance: *runtime.Instance, comptime StateType: type\) ?*T {
            const state = instance.getState\(StateType\)\;
            return if \(@hasField\(@TypeOf\(state.own\), "_internal"\)\) 
                state.own._internal 
            else 
                null\;
        }

        pub fn getOrError\(instance: *runtime.Instance, comptime StateType: type\) \!*T {
            return get\(instance, StateType\) orelse return error.InvalidState\;
        }

        pub fn getCast\(instance: *runtime.Instance, comptime StateType: type\) *T {
            const state = instance.getState\(StateType\)\;
            return @ptrCast\(@alignCast\(state.own._internal\)\)\;
        }
    }\;
}
```

