### Microtask Checkpoint Algorithm
Per spec section 8.1.7.3.1:
```zig
pub fn performMicrotaskCheckpoint(event_loop: *EventLoop) void {
    // 1. If performing microtask checkpoint is true, return
    if (event_loop.performing_microtask_checkpoint) return;

    // 2. Set performing microtask checkpoint to true
    event_loop.performing_microtask_checkpoint = true;

    // 3. While microtask queue is not empty:
    while (!event_loop.microtask_queue.isEmpty()) {
        // 3.1 Let oldestMicrotask be result of dequeuing
        const microtask = event_loop.microtask_queue.dequeue().?;

        // 3.2 Set currently running task to oldestMicrotask
        event_loop.currently_running_task = &microtask.as_task;

        // 3.3 Run oldestMicrotask
        microtask.callback(microtask.context);

        // 3.4 Set currently running task to null
        event_loop.currently_running_task = null;
    }

    // 4. For each environment settings object...
    // (Notify about rejected promises)

    // 5. Cleanup Indexed Database transactions

    // 6. Perform ClearKeptObjects

    // 7. Set performing microtask checkpoint to false
    event_loop.performing_microtask_checkpoint = false;
}
```

