- [ ] clearTimeout/clearInterval cancels timer
- [ ] 4ms clamping for nested timers (depth > 5)
- [ ] Throttling when page hidden
- [ ] Timer IDs are unique and monotonic
- [ ] Memory properly freed on clear/fire

