## Overview

This is the foundational phase - all other phases depend on this. Make the runtime layer enforce that stored JS handles are Global \(not Local\).

## Problem

V8 Local handles are stack-bound within HandleScope. When code stores them as `*anyopaque`, the pointer becomes dangling after HandleScope ends, causing use-after-free.

## Tasks

