Add FFI bindings for libcurl's slist API used to retrieve and manipulate cookie lists.

## Background
CURLINFO_COOKIELIST returns cookies as a curl_slist linked list. Each node contains a Netscape cookie file format string:
`domain\tsubdomain\tpath\tsecure\texpiry\tname\tvalue`

## Functions to Add

### curl_slist_append
