## Background
WebSocket handshakes are HTTP requests that should include cookies. The initial HTTP upgrade request needs to send cookies, and any Set-Cookie headers in the handshake response should be stored.

## Integration Points

### 1. Add Cookie Manager to WebSocket Backend
