## Problem

`src/service_worker/` \(~30 occurrences\) uses `*anyopaque` for event handling.

## Analysis

Per `specs/idl/service-workers.idl`:
```idl
interface ExtendableEvent : Event {
  undefined waitUntil\(Promise\<any\> f\)\;
}\;

interface FetchEvent : ExtendableEvent {
  readonly attribute Request request\;
  readonly attribute Promise\<any\> handled\;
  undefined respondWith\(Promise\<Response\> r\)\;
}\;
```

## Solution

Use proper event type hierarchy:

```zig
pub const ExtendableEvent = struct {
    base: Event,
    waitUntilPromises: std.ArrayList\(*AsyncPromise\(runtime.JSValue\)\),

    pub fn waitUntil\(self: *ExtendableEvent, promise: *AsyncPromise\(runtime.JSValue\)\) \!void {
        try self.waitUntilPromises.append\(promise\)\;
    }
}\;

pub const FetchEvent = struct {
    base: ExtendableEvent,
    request: *Request,
    response_promise: ?*AsyncPromise\(*Response\),

    pub fn respondWith\(self: *FetchEvent, response_promise: *AsyncPromise\(*Response\)\) \!void {
        self.response_promise = response_promise\;
    }
}\;
```

