/// Get header value, isomorphic decode it, and split on commas.
/// Handles quoted strings (doesn't split inside quotes).
///
/// Algorithm:
/// 1. Let input = isomorphic decoding of value
/// 2. Let position = 0, values = empty list, temporaryValue = ""
/// 3. While true:
///    a. Append chars that are not " or , to temporaryValue
///    b. If position not past end AND char is ":
///       - Append collectHttpQuotedString result to temporaryValue
///       - If not past end, continue
///    c. Trim HTTP tab/space from start and end of temporaryValue
///    d. Append temporaryValue to values
///    e. Set temporaryValue = ""
///    f. If past end, return values
///    g. Assert: char is ,
///    h. Advance position by 1
